WEBVTT

00:06.840 --> 00:08.507
Your Highness drinks so readily—

00:08.840 --> 00:11.400
aren't you afraid I poisoned this soup?

00:11.560 --> 00:14.120
If you wanted me dead, you have ten thousand ways.

00:14.200 --> 00:16.280
Why bother serving the poison with your own hands?

00:16.360 --> 00:18.360
I brewed medicinal herbs into the soup;

00:18.920 --> 00:21.253
you won't suffer a hangover headache tomorrow.

00:44.600 --> 00:46.000
Thank you, Sister.

00:51.080 --> 00:53.960
You reek so strongly of wine, it's suffocating.

00:55.720 --> 00:59.480
I suppose dining at someone else's manor is always so much better than eating at home.

01:00.840 --> 01:03.800
Perhaps I should learn their recipes to spice things up,

01:04.040 --> 01:06.747
lest anyone worry I'm letting you starve.

01:07.040 --> 01:10.880
You run this entire household. Who would dare utter a word against you?

01:11.360 --> 01:13.920
Even if they hold their tongues, they'll surely think it in their hearts.

01:14.080 --> 01:16.360
Come along, let us retire early tonight.

01:16.480 --> 01:18.200
When you stay up reading dossiers until dawn,

01:18.280 --> 01:20.613
that flickering candlelight keeps me awake.

01:24.880 --> 01:27.680
Wan'er respectfully bids Your Highness and the Princess Consort good night.
